iler":false,"text":"「う、うぐ……私、ちょっと用事を思い出しましたわ。それじゃ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"160367"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9ee21fc4896bcbfb0f55e39c5638093a7bd4f5632d79e09e84f8b2e0e6fdf5ef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b46ffd235f5ba45bc769c1454ccf163a6be84fab7b9b1963566494b550ba878.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"宮沢ゆあな","creatorId":"vndb:s830","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s830","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s830","name":"宮沢ゆあな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:240651:160367:5915:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c53900","characterName":"七倉 透磨","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"160368","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"240651"},{"characterId":"160368","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"279306"},{"characterId":"160368","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"61565"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16585"],"vndbCharacterId":"c53900"},"originalCharacterName":"七倉 透磨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有紗の兄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこか陰気な雰囲気があり、家にも時々しか帰ってこない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有紗からはだらしないと思われており、呆れられている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16585","sourceWorkId":"15144","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有紗の兄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長身で痩型、ルックスも悪くないにもかかわらず、極度のシスコン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何も知らない有紗からは、だらしない兄と思われており呆れられている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16585","sourceWorkId":"22180","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有紗の